{"strongs": "H2377", "word": "חָזוֺן", "translit": "cha.zon", "root": "חור", "morph": "H:N-M", "pos": "noun masculine", "gloss": "vision", "definition": "חָזוֺן noun masculine Dan 8:1 vision (on formation compare Lg BN 204 ) — absolute ׳ ח Hos 12:11 + 25 t.; construct חֲזוֺן Isa 1:1 + 8 t. 1. vision , as seen in the ecstatic state || קסם Mic 3:6 || מקסם Ezek 12:24 || חלמות Dan 1:17 || נביא Dan 9:24 ׳ חזה ח Ezek 12:27 ; Ezek 13:16 ׳ ראה ח Dan 8:15 ׳ ראה בח Dan 8:2 (twice in verse); Dan 9:21 ׳ דבּר בח Ps 89:20 חזון נראה אל Dan 8:1 vision appeared unto ; ׳ מצא ח מיהוה Lam 2:9 find a vision from Yahweh ; also Ezek 12:22 ; Ezek 12:23 ; Dan 8:13 ; Dan 8:17 ; Dan 8:26 ; Dan 10:14 ; Dan 11:14 . 2. vision , in the night חֲזוֺן לַיְלָה Isa 29:7 . 3. divine communication in a vision, oracle, prophecy ׳ בקשׁ ח מנביא seek a vision (prophecy) from prophet Ezek 7:26 || דבר (יםׅ 1Sam 3:1 ; 1Chr 17:15 חֲזוֺן לִבָּם יְדַבֵּ֑רוּ Jer 23:16 a prophecy of their own hearts (minds) they speak; חֲזוֺן שֶׁקֶר וְקֶסֶם אֱלִיל וְתַרְמִית לִבָּם הֵמָּה מִתְנַבְּאִים Jer 14:14 false vision and (see אֱלִיל ) worthless divination & deceit of their own hearts they are prophesying ; ׳ כתב ח write the vision Hab 2:2 also Hos 12:11 ; Hab 2:3 ; Prov 29:18 ; Ezek 7:13 (strike out Co ). 4. vision , as title of book of prophecy, ספר חזון נחוּם Nah 1:1 ישׁעיהו ׳ ח Isa 1:1 עבדיה ׳ ח Obad 1:1 of other writings of prophets 2Chr 32:32 .", "definition_html": "<h1><entry onclick=\"bdbid('BDB2662')\">BDB2662</entry> [<entry onclick=\"sn('H2377')\">H2377</entry>]</h1><div class=\"navigation\"><entry onclick=\"bdbid('BDB2661')\">BDB2661</entry> | BIBLICAL HEBREW | <entry onclick=\"bdbid('BDB2663')\">BDB2663</entry></div><p> <bdbheb>חָזוֺן</bdbheb> <b>noun masculine</b><sup><ref ref=\"Dan 8:1\" b=\"27\" cBegin=\"8\" vBegin=\"1\" cEnd=\"8\" vEnd=\"1\" onclick=\"bcv(27,8,1)\">Dan 8:1</ref></sup> <highlightword>vision</highlightword> (on formation compare Lg<sup>BN 204</sup>) — absolute <bdbheb>׳</bdbheb><bdbheb>ח</bdbh